=== base ===
# Hosting Agreement

This Agreement is made between Larchfield Data Centres Ltd (the "Provider") and Mossgiel Insurance Brokers Ltd (the "Customer").

## 2. Services
2.1 The Provider shall host the Customer's quoting platform in a UK data centre.

## Schedule 2 Service Levels
1. The Provider shall ensure the platform is available 99.5% of each month.
2. The Provider shall respond to Severity 1 incidents within 1 hour.
=== amendment ===
# Second Amendment

This Amendment is made on 11 June 2027 between Larchfield Data Centres Ltd (the "Provider") and Mossgiel Insurance Brokers Ltd (the "Customer").

## 1. Amendments
1.1 Schedule 2 is deleted and replaced with the schedule set out in the Annex to this Amendment.

## Annex Replacement Schedule 2
1. The Provider shall ensure the platform is available 99.9% of each month.
2. The Provider shall respond to Severity 1 incidents within 30 minutes.
